<div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, =
sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">
I tried to make an PR fixing the inconsistencies between abstract and =
header:</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
- Adding all obsolete drafts from the abstract to the heading</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
- fixing that 8422 is not both updated and obsoleted</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
- Changed "Negotiated Groups" to "Supported Groups". The term =
"Negotiated Groups"</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
is only used once and never again.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, =
sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
<a =
href=3D"https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/tls/Raci4Lxm1Tk9IxrCpyQgJHMl=
XBw/" =
target=3D"_blank">https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/tls/Raci4Lxm1Tk9Ix=
rCpyQgJHMlXBw/</a></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, =
sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">
<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
Eric Rescorla wrote:</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;I'm now trying to recall why we did this. ISTM that given that we =
are</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;obsoleting 5246 (already done in 8446), we should obsolete all =
the</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;other specs that only meaningfully apply to 5246. Here's the</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;list:</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt; * RFC 5077: Transport Layer Security (TLS) Session Resumption =
without</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;Server-Side State</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt; * RFC 5246: The Transport Layer Security (TLS) Protocol Version =
1.2</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt; * RFC 5705: Keying Material Exporters for Transport Layer Security =
(TLS)</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt; * RFC 6066: Transport Layer Security (TLS) Extensions: =
Extension</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;Definitions</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt; * RFC 6961: The Transport Layer Security (TLS) Multiple Certificate =
Status</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
font-size: 12pt;">
&gt;Request Extension</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; =
